---
---

<section id="journey" class="py-24 max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12">
  <div class="mb-12 reveal">
    <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-[4px] text-[var(--text-muted)]">
      Professional Journey
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative pl-8 sm:pl-12 border-l border-[var(--border-frame)] ml-2 sm:ml-4">
    
    <!-- Timeline Item 1 -->
    <div class="relative pb-14 reveal reveal-d1">
      <div class="absolute -left-[33px] sm:-left-[49px] top-1.5 w-6 h-[1px] bg-[var(--text-primary)]">
        <div class="absolute right-0 -top-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--text-primary)]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-bold bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] px-3 py-1 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
        OCT 2025 — JAN 2026
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">IT Security & Infrastructure Intern</h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-muted)] block mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Pride Bank Uganda · Business Technology</span>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Rotational enterprise experience across Business Technology functions within a regulated Tier-2 financial institution. Hands-on practice spanning Active Directory domain administration, physical Cisco router and switch configurations (VLANs, ACLs, OSPF), and Information Security governance—including daily SOC status reporting, endpoint monitoring via Cisco ISE, and core banking channel security reviews.
      </p>
      <div>
        <a href="/reports/Internship Report.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 border border-[var(--border-frame)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] text-[var(--text-primary)] hover:border-[var(--text-primary)] hover:bg-[var(--bg-elevated)] text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] shadow-sm">
          <span>📄</span> View Report ➔
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Timeline Item 2 -->
    <div class="relative reveal reveal-d2">
      <div class="absolute -left-[33px] sm:-left-[49px] top-1.5 w-6 h-[1px] bg-[var(--text-primary)]">
        <div class="absolute right-0 -top-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--text-primary)]"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block font-mono text-[0.75rem] font-bold bg-[var(--text-primary)] text-[var(--bg-canvas)] px-3 py-1 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">
        2023 — 2026
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight">BSc. Networking & Cybersecurity</h3>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--text-muted)] block mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">Isbat University · Kampala, Uganda</span>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--text-body)] max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Comprehensive study of network architecture, security frameworks, digital forensics, and threat modeling. Final-year project focused on AI-driven vulnerability classification. <strong class="text-[var(--text-primary)] font-semibold">CGPA: 4.72</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
